From: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: exclude same-ingress bridge fallback

Retain the new upstream local-MAC classification, which already fixes the
old PACKET_HOST false positive. Add only the missing same-ingress exclusion
so bridge fallback cannot bind intra-BSS or port self-loop traffic.

Signed-off-by: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>
---

--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe.c
@@ -1060,7 +1060,7 @@
 	 * GDM netdev, or a DSA user port.
 	 */
 	egress = (struct net_device *)stack.path[1].dev;
-	if (!egress) {
+	if (!egress || egress == skb->dev) {
 		rcu_read_unlock();
 		dev_put(master);
 		return false;
